.Dd October 4, 2026
.Dt CAT 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm cat
.Nd concatenate files
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Fl u
.Op Ar file ...
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
reads each
.Ar file
in sequence and writes it to stdout.
if
.Ar file
is a single dash
.Pq Sq \&-
or absent,
.Nm
reads from stdin.
.Sh OPTIONS
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Fl u
ignored, output is unbuffered.
.El
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Ex -std
